<Base title="Our story · Cakeopedia Austin" description="Cakeopedia began in Hyderabad with homemade treats for family and now bakes in Austin, Texas." current="/story/">
  <div class="wrap page-head prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our story</p>
    <h1>A love of getting the flavour just right</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:var(--space-3)">Cakeopedia began in Hyderabad, with homemade treats for family.</p>
    <p>During lockdown, one cake experiment became many: testing recipes, changing flavours and adding a personal touch. Cakes for family, friends and college celebrations soon brought requests for orders.</p>
    <p>Today, that same love of baking continues in Austin, with quality ingredients and taste at the heart of it.</p>
    <div class="note" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)"><p>This is a draft of the story, shared for review by the baker. A name and portrait will be added only if the baker chooses.</p></div>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/creations/">See the collection</a></div>
  </div>
</Base>
